      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-702.0,"yMin":-2075.0,"xMax":-348.0,"yMax":-1956.0},"title":"List
      contains Item","body":"\nThe node cannot be used in this situation because
      :\n\n- It checks for EXACT GAMEOBJECT references\n- It does NOT check for properties
      \n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"6ddb391d-b94b-4a06-b872-d39fa8ee1b35","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":833.0,"y":270.0},"guid":"d6acf602-e108-42dd-b5ee-0d2388fa72eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"34"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":277.0,"y":-411.0},"guid":"98b461c8-9612-46c1-8d48-f0166027dc72","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"1214"},{"numeric":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":431.0,"y":350.0},"guid":"697d8510-7727-4fbf-9b08-04ee07d3aae5","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Equal","$id":"1216"},{"argumentCount":0,"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{"target":null,"name":{"$content":"NextTurn","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-148.0,"y":-683.0},"guid":"9826034e-fcb6-42aa-b1b2-d16e6e15ccc1","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.CustomEvent","$id":"1218"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":583.0,"y":271.0},"guid":"292374a0-066a-4322-ba68-cf3f455d1f68","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"1220"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":-169.0,"y":-547.0},"guid":"db0f7fb7-080f-4686-9f6a-1b7a802b0178","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"1222"},{"nest":{"source":"Embed","macro":null,"embed":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[{"key":"In","label":"In","summary":null,"hideLabel":false}],"controlOutputDefinitions":[{"key":"Out","label":"Out","summary":null,"hideLabel":false}],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"PlayerHuman","summary":null,"pan":{"x":-416.548,"y":-13.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x"